# MCP tool names and what the pre-tool hook decides for each, one
# "<deny|ask|allow> <tool name> [<tool input as JSON>]" per line, the input
# {} when left out. The state is the one commands.cases uses. The names cover
# every form seen on this machine and the trackers the plan names. "allow"
# means the hook stays out, and Claude Code's own permission settings decide.
#
# Posting: comment, reply, review, reaction, send_message, post_message,
# schedule_message.
